window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>We're all that stands between Avilion and ruin . . .</p> <p>The Seelie Palace was destroyed, and the royal family is in danger.</p> <p>But the Unstained Souls aren't done with us.</p> <p>Fortunately, the guys are willing to put their differences aside to search for the princess—and the Queen herself is ready to go on the warpath and destroy all mortals living in the Fae lands.</p> <p>But if we don't find her in time . . . this might be the end of everything we know.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
